order: 2
optionOf: personified-dragon-ball
optionEffect: 6
description: >
  Spend up to 4 Negative Energy to turn all Squares within a Sphere AoE (centered on you) into the Bog Environment. For every Negative Energy spent after the first, increase the Magnitude of this effect by 1.
text: >
  Hazy Dragon [Triggered/Power, 1/Round]: Spend up to 4 Negative Energy to turn all Squares within a Sphere AoE (centered on you) into the Bog Environment. For every Negative Energy spent after the first, increase the Magnitude of this effect by 1.

